      "en": "Persia, Cush, and Put with them, all of them with shield and helmet;",
      "ko": "그들과 함께 한바 방패와 투구를 갖춘 바사와 구스와 붓과",
      "source_text_hash": "dd93b798c472a9a2613d6748173efd511794f08aa0e520c3578bc9daf89211cb",
      "translation_text_hash": "67ba3b2aabca79d7b4620ea9b6fc70e5f2c1a7c9420b2af1b5d1ef85e5021a16",
