        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 38,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "You will ascend. You will come like a storm. You will be like a cloud to cover the land, you and all your hordes, and many peoples with you.”",
      "ko": "네가 올라오되 너와 네 모든 떼와 너와 함께한 많은 백성이 광풍 같이 이르고 구름 같이 땅을 덮으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "f9b9e1232a81bd3dab6794b8530d6a4b4c47806bcd84095b3dcbadcf59cf264b",
      "translation_text_hash": "38589f2b6233f7c8421ac378d2cf9b12c99ee4cdbd6927a7bb92188b60c0a6f3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
