      "en": "You will come from your place out of the uttermost parts of the north, you, and many peoples with you, all of them riding on horses, a great company and a mighty army.",
      "ko": "네가 네 고토 극한 북방에서 많은 백성 곧 다 말을 탄 큰 떼와 능한 군대와 함께 오되",
      "source_text_hash": "e5980f13169c9816b45c4213ebeadfc8acd6083220f3aaa3409a804479c5eb89",
      "translation_text_hash": "51f9c5b1d414949214090d41e8b58f1749398c33e03a85f859d466d407a0c003",
